  "abstract": "<jats:p>Necessary and sufficient conditions are derived for a cubic to be monotone on an interval. These conditions are used to develop an algorithm which constructs a visually pleasing monotone piecewise cubic interpolant to monotone data. Several examples are given which compare this algorithm with other interpolation methods.</jats:p>",
